Roboyo&nbsp; AI&nbsp; is a category shaper in Applied AI and Agentic Automation. &nbsp; We help leading enterprises move from automation projects and AI experiments into governed, production-grade systems that execute real work across workflows, processes, &nbsp; products&nbsp; and services. &nbsp; 

Our heritage is in scaled enterprise automation; our future is&nbsp; Applied AI and&nbsp; Agentic&nbsp; Automation: autonomous agents, AI engineering squads, process orchestration, data and knowledge foundations, and human-in-the-loop governance embedded deeply into how our clients&nbsp; operate. &nbsp; 

We are not here to sell AI theatre. We are here to turn AI into&nbsp; working systems, measurable&nbsp; outcomes&nbsp; and repeatable transformation programs. &nbsp; 

&nbsp; 

About the role: 

We are currently looking for a&nbsp; Lead Intelligent Automation Engineer - UiPath&nbsp; to join our Delivery Team in India Hyderabad . &nbsp; 

Be part of a team that is successfully implementing the most advanced and intelligent technologies for our customers. The&nbsp; Lead Intelligent Automation Engineer&nbsp; will be a key member of our Delivery Team, with a specific focus on&nbsp; leveraging&nbsp; the Microsoft Power Platform to create innovative solutions for our clients. As&nbsp; an&nbsp; Lead&nbsp; in&nbsp; Intelligent Automation, you will lead workflow ideation and delivery that streamline business processes, increase efficiency, and enable digital transformation across a wide array of industries. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

KEY RESPONSIBILITIES &nbsp; 

Technical Leadership&nbsp; 

- Set and enforce UiPath development standards, architectural patterns, and delivery frameworks across your team's projects&nbsp; 
 - Act as the technical escalation point for complex automation challenges, integration issues, and solution design decisions&nbsp; 
 - Review and&nbsp; validate&nbsp; solution designs, ensuring they are scalable, maintainable, and aligned with enterprise standards&nbsp; 
 - Oversee the quality of UiPath deliverables across all project stages - design, build, test, and deployment&nbsp; 
 - Stay ahead of UiPath platform developments and translate new capabilities into improved delivery approaches&nbsp; &nbsp; 

Delivery & Project Oversight&nbsp; 

- Oversee end-to-end delivery of client engagements, ensuring projects are delivered on time, within budget, and to the highest quality standards&nbsp; 
 - Monitor project KPIs, proactively manage risks, and put mitigation plans in place before issues escalate&nbsp; 
 - Ensure compliance with&nbsp; Roboyo's&nbsp; internal delivery processes, governance frameworks, and quality standards&nbsp; 
 - Manage project scope, timelines, and resource allocation across concurrent engagements&nbsp; &nbsp; 

WHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR &nbsp; 

- 8+ years of experience in Intelligent Automation software engineering, with hands-on architectural&nbsp; expertise&nbsp; in UiPath. &nbsp; 
 - Proven&nbsp; track record&nbsp; operating as a Technical Lead, successfully managing, staffing, and mentoring engineering teams. &nbsp; 
 - Strong command of advanced software engineering principles and CI/CD operations, including&nbsp; proficiency&nbsp; in SQL, Git version control, and core programming languages required to build custom automation components. &nbsp; 
 - Exceptional stakeholder management and communication skills, with the proven ability to conduct technical workshops, elicit granular business requirements, and negotiate complex architectural decisions with non-technical executives. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

Strong Plus: &nbsp; 

- Hands-on development or architectural experience in Blue Prism (highly valuable for reading and reverse-engineering the legacy codebase). &nbsp; 
 - Proficiency&nbsp; in building custom automation components using C#, . NET, or Python. &nbsp; 
 - UiPath Certified Professional Advanced RPA Developer (UiARD) certification. &nbsp; 
 - Experience integrating AI/ML models or document understanding tools into RPA workflows. &nbsp; &nbsp; 

What We Offer&nbsp; 

- A truly international environment, &nbsp; collaborating on global automation projects. &nbsp; 
 - The opportunity to experiment and innovate&nbsp; with Agentic&nbsp; AI solutions&nbsp; as we pioneer and rebrand our offering in the consultancy space&nbsp; 
 - Work at the&nbsp; core of the automation and AI wave&nbsp; -&nbsp; we're&nbsp; a&nbsp; pure-play automation company&nbsp; fully focused on innovation and future-ready solutions. &nbsp; 
 - A&nbsp; growth-focused environment&nbsp; where&nbsp; you're&nbsp; empowered to&nbsp; develop, &nbsp; excel, and&nbsp; contribute meaningfully&nbsp; - no corporate silos, no red tape. &nbsp; 
 - This is&nbsp; not your standard corporate job&nbsp; - we value initiative over hierarchy, and&nbsp; you'll&nbsp; have room to make a real impact from day one. &nbsp; 
 - A&nbsp; vibrant&nbsp; team&nbsp; culture, collaborative&nbsp; spirit&nbsp; and culture you&nbsp; can't&nbsp; experience anywhere else!&nbsp; &nbsp; 

We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. 

Privacy Notice: By applying, you consent to the processing of your personal data for recruitment purposes in line with our Privacy Policy: https: //roboyo. global/data-privacy/

At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market. 

What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers' success and to our Winning Culture. 

Our customers rank among the who's who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2, 400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform. 

Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating our wins - big and small. 

Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, values-based and disciplined in execution, you'll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let's build what's next - together!

